#Reduced Groebner basis data
#---
#field characteristic: 3
#variable order:       x1, x2, x3, x4, y1, y2, y3, y4
#monomial order:       graded reverse lexicographical
#length of basis:      8 elements sorted by increasing leading monomials
#---
[1*y4^1,
1*y3^1,
1*y2^1,
1*y1^1,
1*x4^1+1,
1*x3^1+2,
1*x2^1+2,
1*x1^1+2]:
